    "Complete final-image Qt dependency and private-ABI consumer closure; this cohort intentionally excludes QtWebView and QtWebEngine; QtWayland is now included because SonicDE specs BuildRequire qt6-qtwayland-devel.",
    "Check pinned Fedora patches against Qt 6.11.3 and EL10 build dependencies.",
    "The initial bootstrap is not a complete runtime Qt distribution.",
    "Do not keep old Qt 6.10 private-ABI binaries as if they were compatible with Qt 6.11."
  ]
